id: spirit-control-spiritual-elite
name: Spiritual Elite
order: 2
slot: trait
stacks: 2
description: >
  With your newfound expertise, you've grown more efficient at manipulating your energy.
text: >
  Spiritual Elite (2): With your newfound expertise, you've grown more efficient at manipulating your energy.
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of your Spiritual Unique Abilities by 2(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Attacking Maneuvers by 1/4 of their Ki Point Cost (before any reductions are applied).
  (3)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Regain Z(bT) Ki Points.

---

# (1) The Spiritual Unique Abilities' Ki Point Cost 2(T) lower: on their own rows' Cost - the table's (nothing here tells them
# apart from any other Unique Ability).
# (2) Wound 1/4 of the Attacking Maneuver's Ki Point Cost before reductions: the table's.

# (3) At the start of your turn, Z(bT) Ki Points.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 3]
ki.value += $Z * 1(bT);
